OL,3,AUK to pay 'participation' fee to       
OL,4,Adeliver EU deals                       
OL,6,FThe government has sought to contrast  
OL,7,Fthe financial costs of the deals       
OL,8,Fagainst their overall effect on the    
OL,9,Feconomy, which it estimates will       
OL,10,Freceive an eventual boost by billions a
OL,11,Fyear due to increased trade.           
